stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Waiting for approval" as WaitingForApproval
  [*] --> Draft: import, spreadsheet or edit
  Draft --> Draft: save, engine validates
  Draft --> WaitingForApproval: maker requests approval
  WaitingForApproval --> WaitingForApproval: maker tries to approve, 403 SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN
  WaitingForApproval --> Draft: checker rejects with a comment
  WaitingForApproval --> Scheduled: checker approves, effective date ahead
  WaitingForApproval --> Live: checker approves, effective now
  WaitingForApproval --> Draft: effective date passed, maker picks a new date
  Scheduled --> Live: effective date reached
  Live --> Retired: a newer version goes live
  Retired --> [*]
  note right of WaitingForApproval
    Engine state PENDING_APPROVAL.
    Approve shown only when allowed actions say so.
  end note
  note right of Scheduled
    UI word for PUBLISHED with a future effectiveFrom
  end note
